  "hypothesis": "EXP-0007 showed that reallocating the 4-use-per-turn ability budget away from Solar Transfer LOSES games (45.0%), because correct Solar Transfer routing is what produced the accepted +7 point gain. If both Teal Dance and Solar Transfer are individually worth running, then ABILITY_CAP_PER_TURN=4 is the binding constraint rather than the ordering, and the cap is an anti-infinite-loop guard tuned on a different deck rather than a strategic limit.",
